### =====================================================================
### TESTE ENDPOINTS AUTH MICROSERVICE
### Baza de date: credential_db (auth-db)
### Traefik Reverse Proxy ruleaza pe portul 80
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost/auth-service
# Alternativa directa fara Traefik (cand microserviciul ruleaza local):
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/auth-service

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Test Login - Cont Administrator (admin / admin123)
### Asteptat: HTTP 200 OK cu token JWT, id, username="admin", role="ADMIN"
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Test Login - Cont Client (client / client123)
### Asteptat: HTTP 200 OK cu token JWT, id, username="client", role="CLIENT"
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "client",
  "password": "client123"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Test Register - Creare cont nou de tip CLIENT
### Asteptat: HTTP 201 Created cu token JWT si datele contului
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "andrei",
  "password": "andrei",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Test Login - Autentificare cu noul cont creat
### Asteptat: HTTP 200 OK cu token JWT valid
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "andrei",
  "password": "andrei"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Test Negativ - Login cu parola incorecta
### Asteptat: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "parolaGresita123"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Test Negativ - Login cu utilizator inexistent
### Asteptat: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "utilizator_inexistent_999",
  "password": "oriceParola"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Test Negativ - Inregistrare cu username deja existent (duplicat)
### Asteptat: HTTP 409 Conflict
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "parolaNoua123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Test Negativ - Body invalid (campuri vide)
### Asteptat: HTTP 400 Bad Request
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Test Validare Token JWT (inlocuieste token-ul dupa un login reusit)
### Asteptat: HTTP 200 OK cu payload decodat
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate
